        "description": "One Resy venue for a date and party size: id, name, link, cuisine, price band, average ticket, currency, timezone, rating and count, address, city, region, postal code, country, neighbourhood, cross streets, coordinates, phone, website, menu link, Instagram and Facebook, about / why we like it / need to know texts, description, restaurant group, party-size limits and large-party message, Global Dining Access flag, awards, collections; the day's open slots (time, end, seating type, party range, deposit, duration in minutes, tables free), notices; `menu_highlights` (signature dishes), `booking_policy` (deposit, service charge, cancellation fee, cancellation and change cut-offs, large-party rules), `turn_times` (table time by party size), `images_full` (full-size photos), `special_announcement`, `average_ticket_label`, `tax_included`; the calendar of the next year's days (reservation, event, walk-in status) and upcoming events with prices.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/resy-venue",
        "tags": [
          "Resy"
        ],
        "x-credits": 1,
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "url",
